pwm1:m:The idea is to make dao that publish publicly the privet key of a public address.
The funds that sent to this address getting "drain" credit in return.
After 48 hours from now i will make the privet key of the "DARAIN" Credit registry address public.
During this time period starting from now until 48 h end anyone can mint drain credits.
All funds will be sent back to the sending address after 48 h and before privet key revel.
